<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-Y6-001>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-Y6-001" ;
  triage:title "Non-Claude SQLite-failure delivery path missing outward delivery" ;
  triage:description "persist_message_and_seed_workflow in persistence.rs:85-110: when SQLite fails and !allows_claude_jsonl_append(), recover_after_sqlite_failure only queues a companion_nudge plan (used by post-send-hook) but does NOT perform actual non-Claude outward delivery of the original message or the atm-system error message. Sprint Y.6 and delivery-state-machines.md §Non-Claude Harness SQLite failure require 'ATM emits the original message through the non-Claude delivery path' and 'ATM emits a second error message from atm-system@<team> through the same non-Claude delivery path'. DeliveryPersistenceResult::companion_nudge only fires post-send-hook, not non-Claude delivery." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-Y" ;
  triage:triageMode "sprint_review" ;
  triage:category "REQ" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm-core/src/send/persistence.rs" ;
